@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004/invoice-review

### Create Data (deep insert: Email -> _Invoice -> _Item)
# Names match the S/4 service. Email is draft-enabled, so POST creates a DRAFT
# (IsActiveEntity=false); run the draftActivate call below to make it active.
POST {{baseUrl}}/Email
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "EmailUUID": "e1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
    "EmailSubject": "Test",
    "EmailSentDate": "2026-07-23T13:09:10Z",
    "EmailSender": "aismail@abeam.com",
    "EmailBodyHtml": "test",
    "Summary": "test",
    "_Invoice": [
        {
            "InvoiceUUID": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
            "DocumentNumber": "25016078",
            "DocumentDate": "2025-12-10",
            "TotalAmount": 292680.00,
            "Currency": "MYR",
            "TaxAmount": 21680.00,
            "VendorCode": "100234",
            "VendorName": "Zaid Ibrahim & Co",
            "VendorAccountNumber": "21433400001867",
            "VerificationStatus": "P",
            "_Item": [
                {
                    "ItemUUID": "aaaa1111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
                    "Amount": 292680.00,
                    "GLAccount": "6100100",
                    "CostCenter": "108-02600",
                    "InternalOrder": "PTR121-115"
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Activate the draft created above (draft -> active)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Email(EmailUUID=e1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111,IsActiveEntity=false)/InvoiceReviewService.draftActivate
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Read back the active email with its invoices + line items
GET {{baseUrl}}/Email(EmailUUID=e1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111,IsActiveEntity=true)?$expand=_Invoice($expand=_Item)
